{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The two wheels shown below are spun and the two resulting numbers are added.  The probability that the sum is even is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/2/8329d1cf2b3091dbd5a5cc6cf97299841af22092.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(circle((0,0),3)); draw(circle((7,0),3)); draw((0,0)--(3,0)); draw((0,-3)--(0,3)); draw((7,3)--(7,0)--(7+3*sqrt(3)/2,-3/2)); draw((7,0)--(7-3*sqrt(3)/2,-3/2)); draw((0,5)--(0,3.5)--(-0.5,4)); draw((0,3.5)--(0.5,4)); draw((7,5)--(7,3.5)--(6.5,4)); draw((7,3.5)--(7.5,4)); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(-0.75,0),W); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(0.75,0.75),NE); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(0.75,-0.75),SE); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(6,0.5),NNW); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(7,-1),S); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(8,0.5),NNE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"155\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e4199a812a807883b1cb842ef25130c73c7357b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{6} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{3} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{12} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"358\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An even sum occurs when an even is added to an even or an odd is added to an odd. Looking at the areas of the regions, the chance of getting an even in the first wheel is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd0f9f9869b39e79527f9010293adf7bfe5210f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and the chance of getting an odd is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdcb968f4f3d2e0d78a67fedc92a8d31183b2436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. On the second wheel, the chance of getting an even is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611d08a8c57a214b2b964bba16da8157a5b81c9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and an odd is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/ebafcc60a28d8759185d7808c60ea53efc73938e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> , resulting in an answer of D.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8da92819d08fca6fd8ed07eab95a4438f08f460d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac14 \\cdot \\frac23 + \\frac34 \\cdot \\frac13 = \\frac16 + \\frac14 = \\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{12}}\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1994 AJHSME P